# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Claude authentication — provide ONE of the following two options
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Option A (recommended for local dev): Claude Code OAuth token.
# Uses your Claude Pro / Max subscription instead of pay-as-you-go API credits.
#
# How to generate:
#   1. Make sure the Claude Code CLI is installed and you're logged into your
#      Claude.ai account (`claude` -> /login if needed).
#   2. Run:  claude setup-token
#   3. Copy the printed token (starts with `sk-ant-oat...`) into the value below.
#
# Notes:
#   - Sandcastle forwards all .env vars into the sandbox, so this is all you need.
#   - If both this and ANTHROPIC_API_KEY are set, Claude Code prefers the OAuth token.
#   - See https://github.com/mattpocock/sandcastle/issues/191 for context.
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=

# Option B (fallback): Anthropic pay-as-you-go API key.
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# Leave blank if you're using CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN above.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub authentication
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# GitHub personal access token used by `gh` inside the sandbox to read issues,
# create branches, open PRs, etc.
#
# Easiest way to get one:
#   gh auth token        # prints the token gh CLI is already using locally
#
# Or create a fine-grained token at:
#   https://github.com/settings/tokens
# Required scopes: repo, read:org, workflow (for PR + issue automation).
GH_TOKEN=
